      "description": "Glass-glass solar photovoltaic modules engineered and developed at SOLARWATT's Dresden headquarters. Bifacial half-cut TOPCon n-type cells. 30-year product warranty and 30-year performance warranty guaranteeing 90% output at year 30. Fire Class A. Tested against PID, LeTID, hail, storm, sandstorm, cyclone, salt mist and ammonia. Supplied and installed in the Republic of Ireland by Local Power Ltd, SOLARWATT's Premium Installer.",
