      "description": "Mobile battery storage unit that works alongside an existing diesel or HVO generator. The generator runs only to recharge the battery, at full load and full efficiency, while the site runs silently from stored power between cycles. Reduces generator runtime by up to 50%, cutting fuel cost, noise and Scope 1 emissions. Industrial-grade lithium in a weatherproof enclosure with integrated battery management system. Supplied in Ireland by Local Power Ltd for hire or purchase.",
